# Force git to always diff source files as text. Without this, any file
# that ever contains a stray control/NUL byte (e.g. a typo'd test fixture)
# gets silently treated as binary by git's content-sniffing heuristic —
# "Binary files a/... and b/... differ" instead of a reviewable diff — even
# after the offending byte is removed, for as long as an old binary-sniffed
# blob remains reachable in history. This repo has no binary assets (see
# AGENTS.md: no images/fonts), so it's safe to force text diffing everywhere
# these extensions appear.
*.js diff
*.json diff
*.md diff
*.html diff
*.css diff
